{%- comment -%}
Local head include override — appends a site-wide brand stylesheet link.
This is intentionally minimal: it only adds a link to assets/css/brand-overrides.css.
Because the theme's original head is gem-owned, keeping this file minimal reduces risk.
If you find runtime assets or meta tags missing, restore the original head include from the gem
or adapt this file to include the necessary tags.
{%- endcomment -%}

<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ '/assets/css/brand-overrides.css' | relative_url }}">
